text = "The Nighmare
After running from the outside world, you found a abandoned mansion and decided to go inside and get yourself some sleep.
Now, trapped in the dark you notice you are not alone.
Bicho Papão is hunting you.
Find the key and escape through the main door.
Do not let him catch you. With every time he catches, your fear grows and your light shrinks.
If you fall into complete darkness, you sleep forever.

















Presse ENTER to wake up."
